      <div type="clause" n="1.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IudDeiVIII">Iud Dei VIII</ref> 1.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">þæt ge ne genedon, þæt ge þis husl ðicgon ⁊ to ðisson weofode ne gán, gif ge þis dydon, þe ge betogene syndon, oððe wiston, hwa hit dide.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">that you dare not share this Eucharist or approach this altar if you have done what you are accused of, or if you knew who did it.</ab>
      </div>
